अयुक्त: कामकारेण फले सक्तो निबध्यते ॥ १२ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1626,\"bb\":1439,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/12/b1439/\",\"body_value\":\"yuktaḥ karma-phalaṁ tyaktvā
śāntim āpnoti naiṣṭhikīm
