अज्ञानेनावृतं ज्ञानं तेन मुह्यन्ति जन्तव: ॥ १५ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1647,\"bb\":1457,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/15/b1457/\",\"body_value\":\"nādatte kasyacit pāpaṁ
na caiva sukṛtaṁ vibhuḥ
ajñānenāvṛtaṁ jñānaṁ
tena muhyanti jantavaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1648,\"bb\":1458,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/15/b1458/\",\"shadow_value\":\"na – never; ādatte – accepts; kasyacit – anyone’s; pāpam – sin; na – nor; ca – also; eva – certainly; su-kṛtam – pious activities; vibhuḥ – the Supreme Lord; ajñānena – by ignorance; āvṛtam – covered; jñānam – knowledge; tena – by that; muhyanti – are bewildered; jantavaḥ – the living entities.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"ādatte\",\"translation\":\"accepts\"},{\"word\":\"kasyacit\",\"translation\":\"anyone’s\"},{\"word\":\"pāpam\",\"translation\":\"sin\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"nor\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"su-kṛtam\",\"translation\":\"pious activities\"},{\"word\":\"vibhuḥ\",\"translation\":\"the Supreme Lord\"},{\"word\":\"ajñānena\",\"translation\":\"by ignorance\"},{\"word\":\"āvṛtam\",\"translation\":\"covered\"},{\"word\":\"jñānam\",\"translation\":\"knowledge\"},{\"word\":\"tena\",\"translation\":\"by that\"},{\"word\":\"muhyanti\",\"translation\":\"are bewildered\"},{\"word\":\"jantavaḥ\",\"translation\":\"the living entities\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1649,\"bb\":1459,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/15/b1459/\",\"body_value\":\"Nor does the Supreme Lord assume anyone’s sinful or pious activities. Embodied beings, however, are bewildered because of the ignorance which covers their real knowledge.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1650,\"bb\":1460,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/15/b1460/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1651,\"bb\":1461,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/15/b1461/\",\"body_value\":\"ajño jantur anīśo ’yam
